 When you are invisible the storekeeper won't unblock the door. I assume 
he/she won't do it even when they get mad. Ever notice how the 
storekeeper only blocks the door when you are visible if you have an item 
and come near the door ? Presumably the Dev Team decided that if you are 
invisible the storekeeper won't know where you are and will block the 
door to try and stop you stealing anything. It might also be a carry on 
of the code which makes him refuse you entry if you have a pickaxe or are 
invisible.

